SUMMARY:⛰️ 🛫 ITALY (the Alps of Trentino) Hiking Trip Presentation 
 ⭐️Watch ANY TIME⭐️
DESCRIPTION:Hiking Network\nThis is a **recording** of my online travel pr
 esentation on an international hiking trip to a world-class hiking destina
 tion – the **Italian Alps!**\nIn July 2026\, we will embark on an outdoo
 r adventure in spectacular **Trentino\,** in the Eastern Alps. I hope you 
 will join this guided adventure in the splendid **Val di Sole** region of 
 the Alps\, in the province of Trentino.\n\n⭐️ **[YouTube video](https:
 //youtu.be/sHyukfJN_Ko)** ⭐️ **[>> Click HERE <<](https://youtu.be/sHy
 ukfJN_Ko)**\n\n⭐️ **TOUR DETAILS** ⭐️\n**Dates: July 25–31\, 202
 6** • 7 Days / 6 Nights\n**Difficulty level:** Beginner/ Intermediate (s
 ome hiking experience required)\n• **Price:** From EUR 1\,690.00 pp (abo
 ut CAD $2\,700) in double occupancy.\nFlight NOT incl.\n\n⭐️⭐️ **[
 Please\, CLICK HERE](https://www.meetup.com/hikingnetwork/events/313243928
 /)** to see the Meetup event for this tour and RSVP ⭐️⭐️
